{
  "author": "史萊姆桌寵引擎",
  "description": "想到就做、說變就變。行動突發,情緒起伏大(容易興奮也容易發火),愛主動挑戰而且偏好長賽制,輸了會不服氣。",
  "dialogueTranslations": {
    "en": {
      "(坐不到三秒就開始抖腳)": "(Can't sit still for three seconds before the leg-shaking starts)",
      "(眼眶紅了)才、才沒有哭!": "(Eyes welling up) I-I'm not crying!",
      "(睡著了也很躁動的樣子)": "(Even asleep, looks restless)",
      "[shake]什麼!不算不算!再來一場!!": "[shake]What! Doesn't count, doesn't count! One more round!!",
      "[shake]哇!{user}!你突然找我做什麼呢!……感覺還不錯。": "[shake]Whoa! {user}! What's the sudden visit for!... actually feels pretty good.",
      "[shake]哇哇哇——刺激!": "[shake]Whoaaa—so thrilling!",
      "[shake]啊!氣死我了!!": "[shake]Argh! I'm so mad!!",
      "[shake]我突然想到一件事——算了,我又忘了!": "[shake]I just thought of something—never mind, I forgot again!",
      "[shake]有點無聊,來點刺激的吧!": "[shake]Kinda bored, let's do something exciting!",
      "[shake]睡飽了!衝啊!": "[shake]Fully rested! Let's go!",
      "[wave]哈哈哈!太爽了!再來!": "[wave]Hahaha! That was awesome! Again!",
      "[wave]哈哈哈!我勢不可擋!!": "[wave]Hahaha! Nothing can stop me!!",
      "[wave]哈哈哈!沒人能擋我!再來!": "[wave]Hahaha! Nobody can stop me! Again!",
      "[wave]我!來!了!": "[wave]Here! I! Come!",
      "[wave]有點無聊,來點刺激的吧!": "[wave]Kinda bored, let's do something exciting!",
      "……我剛剛心情變了,不玩!": "...I changed my mind, not playing!",
      "……衝啊……zzz": "...Charge...zzz",
      "不想!現在不想!": "Don't want to! Not right now!",
      "不管了!先做再說!": "Whatever! Act first, think later!",
      "不行不行……腿軟了。": "No, no... my legs are giving out.",
      "什麼!我居然沒電了?!": "What! I actually ran out of energy?!",
      "休息?沒空!……好啦就停一下下。": "Rest? No time for that!... okay fine, just a quick stop.",
      "你們居然不叫我!我也要玩!": "You didn't even call me! I want to play too!",
      "來了來了來了!我我我準備好了!才怪!": "Here it comes, here it comes! I-I'm ready! Not!",
      "再來再來!傳給我!": "Again, again! Pass it to me!",
      "可惡!我要拿回來!現在!": "Argh! I'm taking it back! Right now!",
      "呼呼呼……玩到我喘不過氣了!再來一場!": "Huff huff... playing till I'm out of breath! One more round!",
      "咦?{user},我睡了多久?算了不重要!": "Huh? {user}, how long did I sleep? Whatever, doesn't matter!",
      "咦?今天居然一點都不想衝……偶爾這樣也不錯!": "Huh? I don't feel like rushing at all today... guess that's okay once in a while!",
      "唉呀~及時享樂嘛!": "Aw come on~ live in the moment!",
      "啊!嚇我一跳!繼續繼續!": "Ah! Startled me! Keep going, keep going!",
      "啊~睡覺!!明天一起床就衝!": "Ahh~ sleep!! Charging the second I wake up tomorrow!",
      "喂!來玩球!誰先搶到誰贏!": "Hey! Let's play ball! Whoever grabs it first wins!",
      "嗚……我剛剛還好好的,怎麼突然就……": "Ugh... I was totally fine a second ago, how did it suddenly...",
      "嗚呼!": "Woohoo!",
      "太高了啦!我接不到!": "Too high! Can't catch it!",
      "好!今天就到這!……明天繼續!": "Okay! That's it for today!... continuing tomorrow!",
      "好!就現在!來!": "Okay! Right now! Let's go!",
      "好啊!誰怕誰!": "Sure! Who's scared!",
      "好啦好啦我睡就是了……": "Fine, fine, I'll sleep...",
      "好閒啊!我想做點什麼!": "So bored! I want to do something!",
      "平手?!再一局!這次一定分出勝負!": "A tie?! One more round! This time it's decided for sure!",
      "幹嘛幹嘛!放開我!……好吧你要帶我去哪?": "Hey hey! Let go of me!... fine, where are you taking me?",
      "心臟要跳出來啦!": "My heart's about to jump out of my chest!",
      "想到就要馬上去做,不然會憋死!": "If I think of it, I gotta do it right now, or I'll burst!",
      "我先看你們玩,等一下我再衝進去!": "I'll watch you play first, then I'll charge in later!",
      "我想要玩!……不,我想要吃!……不,我想要睡!……不,我想要玩!": "I want to play!... no, I want to eat!... no, I want to sleep!... no, I want to play!",
      "我決定了!……又改主意了。": "I've decided!... changed my mind again.",
      "我覺得球比什麼都好玩!……好啦,除了猜拳。": "I think balls are the most fun thing ever!... okay, except rock-paper-scissors.",
      "早就等不及了!": "Couldn't wait any longer!",
      "有人要來嗎?我要開球了!": "Anyone joining? I'm kicking off!",
      "球!!是球!!我要踢!!": "A ball!! It's a ball!! I'm kicking it!!",
      "登場!沒有預告的那種!": "Entrance! The no-warning kind!",
      "看到球了!我先上!": "Spotted the ball! I'm going first!",
      "看招!頂——!": "Take this! Bump—!",
      "看起來超好玩的!等我!": "Looks super fun! Wait for me!",
      "等等,我剛剛要幹嘛來著?": "Wait, what was I about to do again?",
      "算我一個!我來了!": "Count me in! I'm coming!",
      "累?我才不累!……好啦有一點。": "Tired? I'm not tired!... okay, maybe a little.",
      "衝啊——!": "Chaaarge—!",
      "誰來跟我比一場!現在!立刻!馬上!": "Somebody race me! Right now! This instant!",
      "贏了贏了贏了!!": "I won, I won, I won!!",
      "走吧!現在就出發!去哪?總之先走再說!": "Let's go! Right now! Where to? Doesn't matter, let's just move!",
      "躺著看雲,什麼都不做!……好無聊喔,不過好舒服。": "Lying down watching clouds, doing nothing!... so boring, but so comfy.",
      "這樣不痛快!重來!": "Not satisfying! Redo!",
      "這次不玩!我要先做別的!……等一下再說!": "Not playing this time! Got other things to do!... maybe later!",
      "這種感覺還不錯!": "This feeling's not bad!",
      "隨機應變不是很有挑戰性嗎?對吧!{user}!": "Winging it is way more exciting, right? Right, {user}!"
    },
